#: src/thumbnailer.c:366
msgid ""
"The thumbnailer-service can not be reached,\n"
"for this reason, the thumbnails can not be\n"
"created.\n"
"\n"
"Install <b>Tumbler</b> or another <i>thumbnailing daemon</i>\n"
"to resolve this issue."
